                "post_type": "post",
                "quote_count": 13,
                "quoted_status_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 187,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Buffer",
                "text": "\ud83d\udea8 Planned Parenthood just announced that they can no longer serve patients in Colorado who are covered by Medicaid because of the Republican\u2019s disastrous budget bill that was just signed into law. \n\nThese restrictions are horrific and cruel for the people who rely on public-funded support and need help the most. \n\nLike thousands of other women, I have also relied on Planned Parenthood for basic care when I couldn\u2019t afford health insurance, and I\u2019m devastated thinking about the women who will be left with nowhere else to go. \nhttps://t.co/UeDlC3s22M",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1752091510,
                "view_count": 22447
            },
            {
                "attached_links_expanded_url": null,
                "attached_links_url": null,
                "attached_medias_preview_url": [
                    "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GvrcZu-XcAENGmj.jpg?name=small",
