                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 9,
                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Sendible",
                "text": "More than 77,000 children in our state don\u2019t have health insurance. \n\nAnd that number is going to be even more staggering with Trump's Big Ugly Bill which makes the largest Medicaid cut in history and guts billions out of our health care system.\n\nAs a mom, my heart breaks for the kids who won\u2019t be able to go to the doctor's office when they're sick or struggling with an illness. We are the richest country in the world. Our kids deserve so much better.\nhttps://t.co/tqluRSp31F",
