                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "We rely on federal workers for our national security, to protect our public lands and mitigate wildfire risk, to provide support for essential benefits like Social Security, Medicaid, & Medicare, and they even ensure we don't collide with other planes midair. Shutdowns have devastating consequences to our workers, our economy, and our safety. \n\nWe must find a bipartisan path forward to lower health care costs & address the urgent needs facing our country.",
