                "text": "Trump's Big Ugly Bill is devastating Colorado families by cutting Medicaid payments for those who care for their disabled loved ones.\n\nEvery day life is already becoming more unaffordable, and this cruel cut could be the breaking point for family caregivers struggling to keep up with housing, food, and medication costs.\n\nThese cuts are unconscionable. Right now, I'm working with my colleagues in Congress to demand @POTUS  roll back these cuts & find a path forward to lower health care costs.\nhttps://t.co/86tgnVg4KT",
