                "text": "Republicans like to say they stand with farmers, but they shut down the government, cutting off farm loans, disaster aid, and affordable health insurance for nearly 30% of farm workers. \n\nThe vast majority of farms here in CO-7 are family-owned. These are families already facing high costs and tough markets thanks to Trump's tariffs. They can\u2019t afford any more instability from this administration.\nhttps://t.co/N7lnnYSNvd",
